      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hermanville%2C_Mississippi"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Episcopal Church of the Epiphany, built in 1887, was relocated in 1985 to the Mississippi Agriculture and Forestry Museum, where it now serves as a chapel.",
